{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared contract fixtures for the format derivation.",
    "",
    "formatOf() in app/client/lib/asset-format.js and format_of() in scripts/to-jsonl.py",
    "compute the SAME value from a qualifiedName. The client renders it as the badge on a",
    "result row; the Python converter writes it into the indexed 'format' field that drives",
    "the facet. If the two drift, a row can show one format while being counted under",
    "another.",
    "",
    "Both sides are asserted against this file:",
    "  app/client/test/format.test.js   (node --test)",
    "  scripts/test_to_jsonl.py         (python -m unittest)",
    "",
    "Add a case here whenever you change either implementation."
  ],
